WEBVTT

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.210
We lost?

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.520
Go, Heatleo!

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.130
I attack with Borrelguard!

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.720
It's your fault, Bit!

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.470
No!  It's your fault, Boot!

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.060
Please vanish, weaklings.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.090
Everyone, can you hear me?

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.980
Let's split apart and search for Lightning.

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.190
What's this?

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.890
Is something still happening?

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.700
LINK VRAINS is realigning.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:46.310
Outside connections have been shut out.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.750
I hope my program works.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.780
There's less Data Material!

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.780
What caused the shut out?

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:34.970
Mirror LINK VRAINS's entrance closed.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:36.850
Restore it immediately.

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.330
I already started.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:02.320
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:09.110
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:16.430
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:23.000
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:29.750
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:36.980
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:43.690
I want to share your pain

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.330
This is a weird place.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.750
What should we do?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.920
Kusanagi's program has activated!

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.900
That felt gross.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.000
All right!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.040
It's working!  Everyone seems okay.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.600
And with this...

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.800
Here it is.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.350
From Kusanagi?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:44.190
Playmaker's ally deals with problems quickly.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.130
He's a skilled hacker.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:50.850
We'll use this as a foothold to 
hack into Mirror LINK VRAINS.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:56.880
With no Data Material, does that 
mean we have to search by foot?

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.360
That may not be possible.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.770
Whoa!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.860
A wall?

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:11.440
We're trapped inside.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:13.810
It's a trap.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.650
Lightning must have done this.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.520
Why do we have to do all this work?

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:26.220
Humans have a strange power called bonds.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:30.670
When they're together, they unleash 
a power we must not underestimate.

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.120
We must avoid unnecessary risks.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.850
Bonds?  Isn't that's superstition?

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.760
We can't say for sure.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.050
There's less of us than them.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.230
We must be careful and 
defeat them one at a time.

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:49.830
Then let's have them watch their 
friends get defeated one-by-one.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:53.690
Make them feel fear and humiliation.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:57.480
That means we're revealing our plan to them.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.830
Go with the flow.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:04.310
Do you think we'll lose 
if they know our plan?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.580
Fine.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:12.890
It'll be advantageous if we 
can break their confidence.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:18.940
I just captured those who 
can broadcast the duel.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.280
Ouch!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.370
Boss!  Who are these people?

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.040
How should I know!

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.610
We're not people.  We're Ignis.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:32.840
Our enemy kidnapped us?

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:37.680
Exactly.  You will work for us.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.180
Don't underestimate us!

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.550
We won't work for the enemy!

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.760
How admirable.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:46.840
You don't have a choice!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.320
What's this?

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.480
If you disobey my orders...  Boom!

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:55.910
You're gone in an instant.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.880
I'll do it.  I'll do anything.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:00.780
Boss!

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:03.980
“While there's a scoop, there's hope!"

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.000
It's “While there's life, there's hope."

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:10.490
Broadcast what we do.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.500
That's Spectre.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:22.770
Why him?  And who's broadcasting this?

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:27.130
It must be Lightning.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.870
I see.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:32.840
I'll execute you one-by-one.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.310
Lightning!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.780
That's Jin!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.150
I never thought I'd meet 
you in a place like this.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:41.580
Film this!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:44.260
Film what Lightning does!

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.630
Sniff...  Understood.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:50.090
Is everyone okay?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:53.870
For now.  You're my first prey.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.840
I see.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.700
They're going after Spectre first.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.530
We're counting on you, Spectre.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:06.800
Using your logic when you 
fought Blood Shepherd...

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:12.660
...you've determined I'm the 
weakest member in my team.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.400
Yes.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:18.610
That's a bit unexpected.  
Let me pull myself together.

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:21.520
I just have to fulfill my mission.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:26.210
I'll defeat anyone who 
interferes with Revolver.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.460
For Revolver, I see.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:34.440
You're a puppet who depends on 
Revolver, giving up his free will.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:38.180
That's why we look down on you.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:41.380
Free will is most important.

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:46.690
We acquired free will thru 
trial and error and struggle.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.520
Hey -  you misunderstand.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.220
I haven't given up my free will.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:57.350
I used my free will to 
choose to obey Revolver.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.850
You must've never had a difficult past.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:04.340
Naturally.  Because you're an AI.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:09.430
Through experience, I learned that I'm weak.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:14.170
The weak coexist with the 
strong to protect himself.

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:17.120
So that's the wisdom of the weak.

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:22.220
Exactly.  Not every person is strong.

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:26.760
Equality is only an ideal.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:30.250
But we AI can do that.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.500
Are you sure?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.630
You can if you're a normal AI.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:40.010
But not if you have free will.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:45.890
You - like humans - will eventually 
start having silly power struggles.

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:49.110
That's the fate of all 
creatures with free will.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:54.080
I didn't expect Revolver's 
minion to think a lot about AI.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:57.300
I don't accept your existence.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:04.860
But when the Ignis created from me vanished, 
I felt an emptiness form inside me.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:06.590
Does he mean Earth?

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:11.490
He sensed the loss of his 
Ignis - a part of himself.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:15.400
Did you just call me a part of yourself?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.340
No I didn't.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:22.580
I couldn't help thinking about the Ignis.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:26.660
I know you're the mastermind 
behind everything.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:31.390
If you stayed quiet in the Cyberse 
World, that Ignis wouldn't have-

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:32.930
Wouldn't have vanished?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.480
That's incorrect.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:41.930
If we stayed quiet in the Cyberse World, 
would the Knights of Hanoi leave us alone?

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:43.650
No, you wouldn't.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:47.500
We're fighting for our survival.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.370
The ones who'll survive are the AI.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:52.970
It's my mission to make that happen.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.380
So it's tough for both of us.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.500
Talking anymore is a waste of time.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.850
I agree.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.420
Then let's begin.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.210
Yes, let's.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:09.020
Duel!

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:11.990
My turn.

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:15.850
I summon Armatos Legio Gladius.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.660
Gladius's effect.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:26.950
I add Armatos Colosseum from my deck to 
my hand and activate the Field Spell!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:47.880
When it activates, I add Armatos Legio 
Speculata from my deck to my hand.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:51.340
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.900
Link Summon!

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:59.070
Appear, Link 1 Armatos Legio Decurion!

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:01.700
Armatos Colosseum's effect!

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:05.980
I send a Level 4 or lower Armatos 
Legio in my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:10.880
I Special Summon an Armatos Legio from my 
graveyard that's not the one I discarded...

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:15.350
...next to Decurion's 
link in defense position.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:18.690
I send Sica from my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:23.190
I Special Summon Gladius 
next to Decurion's link!

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:26.680
I activate Speculata's effect from my hand!

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:31.340
I send a non-Speculata Armatos 
Legio in my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:34.510
Then it Special Summons itself.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:38.980
Appear again!  The circuit 
that guides the light!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.850
Link Summon!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:46.530
Appear, Link 2 Armatos Legio Centurion!

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:52.260
Lightning is expanding quickly!

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:55.180
Armatos Colosseum's effect activates!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.460
I send an Armatos Legio in 
my hand to the graveyard...

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:04.870
...to Special Summon Gladius and 
Sica next to Centurion's links!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:08.280
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.510
Link Summon!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:14.260
Link 1 Decurion!

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:19.350
Appear!  The three arrows 
that judge the world!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:23.330
I activate the Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.900
Judgment Arrows has appeared.

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:29.670
You're going all out.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:32.640
A Link Spell and four monsters.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.600
But now your hand is empty.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:40.940
Have you finished your preparations?

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.610
My turn isn't over yet.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.520
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:52.980
The summoning conditions are two Armatos 
Legio that includes a Link Monster!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.350
Link Summon!

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:59.030
Link 2 Armatos Legio Primi Ordines!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.740
Primi Ordines's effect!

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:06.440
I Special Summon a Level 4 or lower 
Armatos Legio from my graveyard!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.370
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:16.970
The summoning conditions are two Armatos 
Legio that includes a Link Monster!

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.720
Link Summon!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:23.100
Link 2 Armatos Legio Pilus Prior!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:32.920
When it's Link Summoned, I banish a card 
from my deck for every co-linked monster.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:36.990
And I add the banished cards 
to my hand on my next turn.

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:39.770
I banish three cards.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:42.430
Pilus Prior's effect!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:47.190
I Special Summon a Level 4 or lower 
Armatos Legio from my graveyard!

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.650
Resurrect, Gladius!

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:55.250
So this is what you were 
going for from the start.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:56.830
Yes.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:14:00.190
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.460
The summoning condition is a 
Level 4 or lower Armatos Legio.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.130
Link Summon!

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:11.000
Appear!  Link 1 Armatos Legio Decurion!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.510
This is...

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.130
An Extra Link.

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.380
Impossible!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.710
Judgment Arrows connects them!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:27.420
Both Extra Monster Zones have been filled.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:31.000
It's as if his Extra Deck is sealed away.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.630
Spectre can't Link Summon on his next turn.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:37.620
He's in trouble from the first turn.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:40.120
This is Lightning's true strength.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.990
Boss!  This is crazy!

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:48.840
Yeah.  We're going to film 
Playmaker's team lose?

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.970
I end my turn.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:54.380
I've already analyzed your deck.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:15:00.410
I concluded that your deck is dangerous 
if you summon a Link Monster.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:03.440
So I crushed that possibility.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:07.570
Incredible!  Wonderful dueling tactics!

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:10.170
You're my enemy, but you're great.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:17.010
To show you respect, I'll defeat 
you with all my strength.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:26.380
You think you can turn this battle around?

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.000
That's what I'm saying.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:33.310
Spectre's deck relies on Link Monsters.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:37.700
He can't win unless he breaks 
his opponent's Extra Link.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.550
But is there a way to do that?

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:44.530
We must trust Spectre in this duel.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.570
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:52.040
I summon Sunseed Genius Loci!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:57.220
And I Special Summon Sunseed Shadow.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:04.110
I can Special Summon it from my hand when 
there's a Plant monster on the field.

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.070
I've assembled my monsters.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:14.490
But I can't Link Summon because the 
Extra Monster Zones are filled.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:17.250
My data was correct.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:21.990
Other than in your Extra Deck, 
you don't have monsters with ATK.

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:25.250
But since the Zones are 
filled, you can't play them.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.520
Accept your defeat.

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:29.660
I won't do that.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:35.900
I felt an affinity for you after seeing 
your duel against Blood Shepherd.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:37.520
Affinity?

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:41.470
Because your deck's structure 
is similar to mine.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:45.610
The most powerful weapon in 
your deck is Judgment Arrows.

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:50.130
I wish I had a card like that.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.350
But I don't.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:53.890
What are you trying to say?

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.430
This.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:03.410
I pay 800 LP to activate the 
Continuous Spell, Sunvine Plunder!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:09.380
It lets me gain control of a 
faceup spell card on your field!

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:12.940
What?

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.770
I steal what I don't have.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.690
That's how I do things.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.300
Nice idea, Spectre.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.500
Seriously?

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:28.270
I see.  It's simple but effective.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:31.780
Our deck concepts are similar.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:39.410
So I thought if I stole Judgment Arrows, 
my deck would become more powerful.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:44.340
I see.  I never thought we'd be equals.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:48.160
Because you're a bit arrogant.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:54.150
I also lived through struggles, 
so I can sense those things.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:57.990
The cause of your arrogance is a complex.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:01.880
In other words, you have 
some sort of complex.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:05.540
You must have a secret you never told anyone.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.360
Since you're not answering, 
I must've hit the bulls-eye.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.060
I don't care for your probing.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:17.070
My apologies.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.650
Anyway, I acquired Judgment Arrows.

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:26.490
Since it hasn't left the field, your Link 
Monsters aren't unfortunately destroyed.

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:32.620
But now your Extra Link is broken.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:38.420
And I can now Link Summon 
without an Extra Monster Zone.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:42.740
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:45.280
Link Summon!

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:49.050
Link 2 Sunavalon Daphne!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:54.760
And I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Sunvine Shrine!

00:18:55.460 --> 00:19:01.580
When there's a Sunavalon on the field, I can 
activate it by sending my hand to the graveyard!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.890
Sunvine Shrine's effect!

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:09.370
I can Special Summon a Level 4 or 
lower Plant monster from my graveyard!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.570
I Special Summon Genius Loci!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:17.680
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:21.890
The summoning condition is one Plant monster!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.720
Link Summon!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:28.860
Appear, Link 1 Sunvine Thrasher!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:38.370
When it's linked to a Sunavalon, it gains 800 
ATK for every one of Sunavalon's Link Markers.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.960
Daphne has 2 Link Markers.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.170
Therefore, it gains 1600 ATK!

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.630
Battle!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:48.410
Thrasher attacks Decurion!

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.910
The Link Spell, Judgment Arrows's effect!

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:59.990
When a linked Link Monster 
battles, its ATK are doubled!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.180
Primi Ordines's effect!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:11.890
When it's on the field, I take 1000 fewer 
battle damage for every co-linked card.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:15.490
So the damage is reduced by 4000.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:18.970
But your monster will be destroyed.

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.180
Then Thrasher's effect!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.620
When your monster is destroyed in battle...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:32.590
...Decurion is Special Summoned from 
the graveyard next to Sunavalon's link!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:38.930
I attack your Decurion 
with the Decurion I stole!

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:47.940
But due to Judgment Arrows's effect, 
my Decurion's ATK are doubled.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:55.410
Due to Primi Ordines's 
effect, I take 0 damage.

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:58.270
I know that.

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:03.740
I end the battle and activate the 
Continuous Spell, Sunvine Cross Breed!

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:07.710
By tributing a Link Monster on my field...

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:13.120
...I Special Summon a Plant monster from 
my graveyard by negating its effects.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:18.070
I tribute Decurion to 
Special Summon Genius Loci!

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:22.780
Appear!  The future circuit 
that lights up our path!

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:26.870
Link Summon!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:32.390
Appear, Link 1 Sunavalon Dryas!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.080
This can't be the target of an attack.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:39.420
When I take battle or effect damage...

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:43.570
...I can Special Summon a Sunvine 
Link Monster from my Extra Deck.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:47.360
And I regain LP equal to the damage I took.

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:52.200
Spectre has taken back 
the Extra Monster Zone!

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:57.040
Now the outcome is up for grabs.

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:23.530
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:24.970
Even denials are obvious

00:22:24.970 --> 00:22:26.100
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:27.990
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:29.600
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:31.170
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:32.340
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:39.380
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:42.450
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:45.590
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:48.660
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:54.030 --> 00:22:57.230
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:03.370
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:08.780
If we're together

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:12.180
We can seize it

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.030
Steal your opponent's special card.

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:44.370
That's how Spectre duels, altering 
the direction of the match.

00:23:44.370 --> 00:23:49.530
The situation has changed, but 
Lightning's LP are still strong.

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:54.860
Whoever conquers the Extra Monster 
Zone will conquer this duel!

00:23:54.860 --> 00:23:58.060
This is... Extra Link Reversal!

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:02.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Chain Destruction

00:24:02.430 --> 00:24:04.850
Into the VRAINS!
